    affiliation: "School of Public Health, Georgia State University"
abstract: >-
  MechFit.jl is a Julia toolbox for fitting compartmental (SIR/SEIR-family)
  and phenomenological growth models to epidemic time series, with
  parametric-bootstrap uncertainty, short-term forecasting, forecast scoring
  (MAE, MSE, coverage, weighted interval score) and weighted forecast
  ensembles. Its QuantDiffForecast-compatible layer reproduces the error
  models, AICc and scoring conventions of the MATLAB QuantDiffForecast
  toolbox and is validated against an archived version of it.
keywords:
  - epidemic forecasting
  - compartmental models
  - SEIR
  - growth models
  - ensemble forecasting
  - parameter estimation
  - Julia
